        "text_LKXdjG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>With the right tools, it can actually be a fun part of the modern analog photography experience.</p><p>The toneCarrier is a fully-featured, dedicated film holding system specifically designed scanning negative and slide film using a digital camera (DSLR or mirrorless).</p><p>We make it possible to get archival-grade digital copies of your film in minutes. Forget the struggle of slow, bulky and outdated flatbed scanners - scanning with a camera is the modern way to preserve and share your film photography work.</p>",
