          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "text": "I've used pretty much every film scanning setup that's out there and after one roll with the toneCarrier, I'm gonna say this is the best scanning rig available - and not just for the price. The amount of engineering and thought that went into this blew my mind. It took a full day of printing but the assembly took me literally five minutes. It's a robust carrier that keeps my negatives flat and allows me to scan a roll in 1-2 minutes thanks to the beautiful scroll knobs. The complete build feels really heavy in the hands, especially for a 3D print. The only thing I didn't care for were the framing masks. If you want maximum coverage of your negative, I would avoid using them since the corners are rounded; I ended up losing more than I wanted after cropping. Highly recommend the toneCarrier 120!!",
            "author": "Etsy buyer",
            "product": "toneCarrier 120 holder (Mark II)",
            "date": "November 2024",
            "source": "Etsy"
          }
        },
