        "text_mJbbyR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The toneCarrier 35 mm exposes sprocket holes by default, so you can always get the full picture.</p><p>And if you want to hide the holes and remove backlight bleed, use one of the included frame masks in full frame, half frame and X-Pan formats.</p>",
