        "text_braLaT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The toneCarrier 120 supports all common medium format frame sizes: <strong>6x4.5, 6x6, 6x7, 6x8 and 6x9</strong>.</p><p>Enjoy the versatility and scan all formats with one device.</p>",
