        "text_Azk8Pj": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The holder materials are carefully chosen to ensure a smooth, reliable scanning experience every time. The housing is constructed from high quality, matte finish plastic and metal hardware is used where it matters - to increase stiffness and provide buttery smooth film motion.</p>",
